# Testing the correct output for children of a node

created graph simpleGraph

added node A to simpleGraph

the children of A in simpleGraph are:

added node B to simpleGraph

added edge 1.000 from A to B in simpleGraph

the children of A in simpleGraph are: B(1.000)

added edge 2.001 from B to A in simpleGraph
added edge 3.000 from B to B in simpleGraph

the children of A in simpleGraph are: B(1.000)
the children of B in simpleGraph are: A(2.001) B(3.000)
